          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 150049,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bayangkan kita sedang menambahkan class yang bisa dimainkan ke game kita: Knight. Knight menggunakan shield dan meneriakkan kalimat perang saat menyerang.</p><p>Karena subclass dapat memiliki <strong>properti</strong> sendiri, kita dapat dengan mudah menambahkan fitur tambahan ini ke karakter.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 150050,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pertama, kita perlu membuat subclass yang memiliki properti yang sama dengan superclass-nya. Kita akan melakukannya dengan memanggil method <code>super()</code>.</p><p>Tambahkan metode <code>super()</code> untuk memanggil konstruktor superclass.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"constructor\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"254\" endIndex=\"259\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Knight\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;For the realm!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>super</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 150051,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita ingin class <code>Knight</code> memiliki properti <code>sprite</code> yang sama seperti class <code>Player</code>.</p><p>Gunakan <code>super(sprite)</code> untuk memanggil konstruktor class <code>Player</code> dan membuat properti <code>sprite</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Knight\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;For the realm!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" knight = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Knight(\" /><text value=\"&quot;steel-sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(knight.sprite);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"254\" endIndex=\"259\" /><option startIndex=\"259\" endIndex=\"260\" /><option startIndex=\"260\" endIndex=\"266\" /><option startIndex=\"266\" endIndex=\"267\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>super</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>sprite</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 150052,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat membuat subclass <code>Knight</code> menjadi lebih spesifik dengan menambahkan properti ke dalamnya. Kita perlu menambahkan properti tambahan apa pun setelah <code>super()</code>.</p><p>Tambahkan parameter <code>battleLine</code> ke constructor dan simpan sebagai properti.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"250\" endIndex=\"260\" /><option startIndex=\"283\" endIndex=\"312\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Knight\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite, battleLine) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".battleLine = battleLine;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;For the realm!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" knight = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Knight(\" /><text value=\"&quot;steel-sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;For the realm!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(knight.battleLine);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>battleLine</code>,