            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dengan metode <code>attack()</code> yang disesuaikan, setiap instance <code>Knight</code> baru yang kita buat dapat memiliki kalimat pertempuran mereka sendiri.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"498\" endIndex=\"504\" /><option startIndex=\"534\" endIndex=\"550\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Knight\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite, battleLine) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".battleLine = battleLine;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".battleLine);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" aria = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Knight(\" /><text value=\"&quot;steel-sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;No turning back!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" darius = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Knight(\" /><text value=\"&quot;golden-spear&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hold the line!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text t